[[Vision]] is a [[legendary trinket]] obtainable through [[Living World Season 4]]. All six episodes must be unlocked in order to craft this item. Progress can be started by buying the [[Trance Stone]] from any [[Volatile Magic]] vendor in any LWS4 map.

== Lore ==
{{Spoilers|{{Legendary unlock text|"They killed him. [[Balthazar]]. If [[Lyssa]] ever learns of this...I don't know what she'd do—what any of them would do. They still claim benevolence, but let's hope they weren't watching too closely."}}|[[Guild Wars 2: Path of Fire|Path of Fire]]|550px}}

